# Worksheet

**F1 Core loop**: gameState object; mulberry32 seeded, no Math.random found; endTurn() resolves needs→production→events→trade→hazards in fixed order. Score 2

**F2 Map**: 8x8 (64 tiles) generated by generateMap(seed); checkBuildable checks terrain; getAdjacencyBonus feeds calculateProduction's totalMult. Score 2

**F3 Economy**: condenser water feeds greenhouse's water need (real chain); caps enforced in resolveBuildingProduction; BUT production output computed independent of whether consumption succeeded — chain not gated. Score 1

**F4 Population**: colonist records {skill,fatigue,morale,job,assignment}; calculateProduction reads c.skill/c.fatigue for skillMult. Score 2

**F5 Needs**: resolvePopulationNeeds subtracts food/water, drops morale on shortage, recoverable via events; but calculateProduction's skillMult never reads c.morale — morale doesn't change output directly. Score 1

**F6 Research**: 8 nodes; unlockResearch enforces prereq+cost; buildingBonus/damageReduction/stormReduction all read elsewhere; synthesis's metalToWater is dead (never read) but rest of system fully wired. Score 2

**F7 Events**: 10 events; fireEvent does weighted selection via gameState.rng; all 10 have 2 differing choices; cooldowns tracked and decremented each turn. Score 2

**F8 Trade**: tradeCaravanBuy/Sell both work, caravan quantity limited; but globalPrices set once in initTrade and never drifts or reads player stockpiles — just static + small per-caravan noise. Score 1

**F9 Hazard**: checkAndResolveStorm fires periodically, severity scales with turn; damageReduction/stormReduction read from research; but b.hp never read in calculateProduction (no output loss) and repairBuilding() has no call site anywhere (dead). Score 1

**F10 Save/load**: serializeState() → clipboard copy; deserializeState() try/catch with alert() on bad JSON. Score 2

**F11 End conditions**: gameStatus 'won'/'lost' both reachable via turn/population checks in endTurn; showGameOver sums population/research/resources/turn scores; modal rendered. Score 2

**F12 UI**: tabs wired; log entries carry entry.turn; tooltip shows totals but no modifier breakdown; keydown handles Space/1-5; no @media query anywhere for narrow screens. Score 1

**F13 Dev panel**: runTests() has 15 real invariant assertions incl. save/load hash roundtrip; runBenchmark() runs 200 headless turns, computes hashState(), wired to benchmark-btn. Score 2

**G1**: node.effects.buildingBonus read in calculateProduction's researchBonus loop, applied to totalMult every turn. Score 4

**G2**: resolvePopulationNeeds → morale-1 is real; morale→output only via hardcoded 30%-chance departure at morale===0, indirectly cuts assigned workforce. Score 2

**G3**: checkAndResolveStorm mutates b.hp (real state change) but calculateProduction ignores hp entirely, and repairBuilding() is never called from any UI element. Score 1

**G4**: generateCaravan price = globalPrices[res] + small noise; globalPrices never updated over turns, never reads gameState.resources. Score 0

**G5**: applyEventChoice mutates gameState.resources/morale differently per choice (dust_storm_minor, water_shortage checked), called from showEvent button handlers. Score 4

